This package contains TypeScript ports of physics models from pooltool
(https://github.com/ekiefl/pooltool), Copyright Evan Kiefl and contributors,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0):

- pooltool/physics/resolve/ball_cushion/han_2005 (Han 2005 cushion impact)
- pooltool/physics/resolve/ball_ball/frictional_inelastic and friction.py
  (Alciatore ball-ball friction)
- pooltool/physics/resolve/stick_ball/instantaneous_point and squirt.py
  (cue strike, TP A-30 / A-31)

The ports are modified: rewritten without trigonometric functions (frame rotations
by dot products with the unit normal), fixed-step, and adapted to a Float64Array
state layout. The underlying models are from the cited papers (Han 2005; Alciatore
technical proofs A-5, A-6, A-14, A-30, A-31).
